    "ornament": "Almost none: plain boxes with louvred or sliding windows, hand-painted shop boards, deep verandah awnings for shade, woven pandanus and coconut-frond motifs on traditional crafts, WWII relics (guns, aircraft wreckage) in the war memorial park.",
